Trixnity
Copyright connect2x GmbH

This folder contains a copy of Trixnity, the Kotlin Multiplatform SDK for Matrix,
under `commonMain/de/connect2x/trixnity/client`. It is vendored here as a
developer reference so the SDK's behaviour can be read without unpacking the Gradle
cache.

Upstream: https://github.com/connect2x-de/trixnity
